{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/3e7ec4b9d81ae84674b57fea8311d64f.avif?t=1768832773\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Neverwhere Tales - Book 1 is a story-driven Adult Visual Novel. The story takes place in an urban fantasy setting and combines a modern world with cyberpunk and fantasy elements like magic, magical creatures, and supernatural elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Book 1 is the story of Alexander Callister (first name can be changed) and how he learns about this hidden world called &quot;Neverwhere.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/997af5f5af9526e9ab30d874aa24bf92.avif?t=1768832773\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live a normal life. <br>You grew up on the outskirts of the city with parents who were always there for you and your sister.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing school, you applied for a normal job. <br>Now you're working your way up the career ladder and living the corporate life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That all changes one day when you get a call from your mother. You learn that all you believed in as true was a facade. <br> <br>You're confronted with a world you always thought of as fiction or movie material.  <br>How you deal with this new situation, this new world, who you trust or not... that is up to you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/c850b61e61dffc670a9614998ce1b3e5.avif?t=1768832773\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access version already comes with an image gallery, a cinematics gallery, achievement functionality, and a chapter summary at the end summarizing the decisions you made.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tempus Fugit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/187f591bebbda622cd2da61114f37250b71020ed.jpg"},{"name":"My Favorite Bartender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/c191a77eeca091a4665e620a58138bf30afac178.jpg"},{"name":"Thirteen Miles in Thirty Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/a8d902d2790f2c84d8a2c6d786b851c8a4b0c5d2.jpg"},{"name":"Neverwhere? Nowhere? Neverland?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/4591f44ee8cc497d55aaf8ba7925ad84c4d20b0e.jpg"},{"name":"Ginger Disaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/80dd89350d18f4084d4b221ea8122381b1a7ad6f.jpg"},{"name":"Repeat Offender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/162d8170334a550dba077e6136222e7317e40e42.jpg"},{"name":"Coffee Addicted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/d2f00f851829c8902af2ccf5899e75134054a081.jpg"},{"name":"Double Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/43d670129e973553764b7405bed3160932f9aaa9.jpg"},{"name":"The Mandela Effect","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/d0d50237d133686e5c8663ab422efe76988ea61c.jpg"},{"name":"Truth Revealed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2639380/f80eae0105ef74df99b05d874fce7c8dee954015.jpg"}],"total":82},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2639380?t=1768832773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2639380?t=1768832773","capsule_image":"http