=\"bb_paragraph\" >That all changes one day when you get a call from your mother. You learn that all you believed in as true was a facade. <br> <br>You're confronted with a world you always thought of as fiction or movie material.  <br>How you deal with this new situation, this new world, who you trust or not... that is up to you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/extras/c850b61e61dffc670a9614998ce1b3e5.avif?t=1768832773\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The early access version already comes with an image gallery, a cinematics gallery, achievement functionality, and a chapter summary at the end summarizing the decisions you made.</p>","developers":["ceodev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2639380/header.jpg?t=1768832773","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu / SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 750 or better, AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenGL 2, DirectX 9 or OpenGL ES 2 required</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.6 or higher (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 750 or better, AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<